{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">After surviving a shipwreck on the very edge of the charted seas, you stand before the daunting challenges of mysterious lands waiting to be discovered.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>GATHER, BUILD, CRAFT AND SURVIVE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587400/extras/BeyondTheMap_DemoGameplay.gif?t=1742926687\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Establish your base, master a variety of professions to craft and upgrade your equipment, and forge your path without the constraints of traditional classes. Level up your skills, and search the world for rare spellbooks that grant you extraordinary powers!<br><br>This free demo contains 1 single biome island.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3587400?t=1742926687","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587400/e1801bc1060b9bd16c8be7c5ab0b769d3858bee7/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1742926687","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587400/ad77eb37bec339900dad59cb546d7ef6b49ad103/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1742926687","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587400/ad77eb37bec339900dad59cb546d7ef6b49ad103/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1742926687","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">After surviving a shipwreck on the very edge of the charted seas, you stand before the daunting challenges of mysterious lands waiting to be discovered.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>GATHER, BUILD, CRAFT AND SURVIVE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587400/extras/BeyondTheMap_DemoGameplay.gif?t=1742926